{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/jxmk8cdcvttpkp4ywc9j9krwmmqp60q.mp3","text":"Thermal-EX，热量冲击准备启动！什么，尚未到达指定作战时间吗？那就延后一下。10秒后再启动冲击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/jru54v8philbvnfw6s7diyap0umsbmu.mp3","text":"听说东方有句古话：天下武功，唯热不破。","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/kzstlqnw4gw68iadhb3dncws7krfdxm.mp3","text":"博士！能和你在一起真是太棒了！我炽热的内心久久无法平静！——我是说我身上所搭载的雷神工业定制款全量热力法术冲击发生器！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/q8v0nluthfyuywuvwjnceegq4170w1a.mp3","text":"很久以前，神灵说：“要有光”于是就有了光，神灵又说：“要有力量。”于是就有了雷神挑衅者熔岩猫魔鬼高性能版。","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_004.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/p9yr9u5tohmz7581vafijbku5u4en6b.mp3","text":"作为一台完美的工业级量产型作战平台，我感到非常高兴！如今不但有梅尔小姐在不断优化我的性能，还有煌小姐这样灼热的伙伴能成为我的好搭档！太棒了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/ru5t3rvhga7e42vr5wrserqlvlhsdfs.mp3","text":"虽然我已经如此耀眼，但是对我来说，只有无人能敌的博士您才是最闪耀的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/2hnec317nh8yasvmhjc0sysm32p3zkr.mp3","text":"我知道我能发出的光与热是如此短暂......但是，只要能照亮博士博士您前进的道路就好！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/iqqtbxnly1rkhok969d5972jm4iqvra.mp3","text":"即使在你休眠的时候，我也可以作为你的暖炉工作！真不愧是我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/0p6odg5ufkxxg1rex171d65xoqoz40a.mp3","text":"诞生于雷神工业，改进于伟大的梅尔之手，膨胀的炙热之心——Thermal-EX ，前来助阵！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/kvxpvi6u46qncn1qsmdzhaepia146an.mp3","text":"嗷嗷！这股炽热的力量是......是......是热更新！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_012.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/df1x4ol1733bj4e69unx86d8lqwuybx.mp3","text":"轮到我大显身手了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/5ze14s1g9hui32384z1vvhlhm8iu2ij.mp3","text":"现在情况如何？","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/5epsvf7u2kt1c32c1709f0atbjlm71k.mp3","text":"全军出击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/enrku6dl86a8ppex0vjvt7mbhk85hkr.mp3","text":"摇滚起来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/d9vb769xkv6edl8920581xf54kf5i5w.mp3","text":"准备发射！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/8ckhzh13l7ov482bllv96nr5ithuof6.mp3","text":"蓄能中！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/3ujw84iq2o1syupek88zgzcj0bg14lh.mp3","text":"我来帮你！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/s6nlrg671aivx7hyml9e43dd2pwhmpk.mp3","text":"冲击准备！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/i7z4nea7vmnei2vbms5tjjht401go2q.mp3","text":"Sonic Boom—!","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/6acujskc8zp3nwm2tsdl4imdsk9u0j4.mp3","text":"开始冲击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/nl41nr2flt61pnqcel0gj5aye0nwrq3.mp3","text":"看我的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/aprqaiem9vnt0oeime7gudxl41bsrfv.mp3","text":"赞美热量！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/gfs2wth0dyrcxlxb078pzfok59dkvux.mp3","text":"不愧是我！果然博士博士的指挥和我才是绝配啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/obbpxprlt3iklizo08dx9z645b8albw.mp3","text":"非~常~完~美！！！！博士博士！！！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/kgttr66pnlt89b71c760nu7jvti6et3.mp3","text":"我的撤退纯属意外，原本一定不会有漏网之鱼的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/o0rbghf8tz6iac9q7a8oyu8v2d1hled.mp3","text":"危险，被暗算了！烟雾弹已投放！博士，我来掩护你撤退！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/c01wck5fhu1ws11w6k3zaujwo892myu.mp3","text":"休息吗？哈哈对我来说还早着呢！我刚更换新的储能装置，离今天的工作结束还有50小时呢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/o7eotw8b6estd9r42g9w7ecfpxy2sto.mp3","text":"唔呵！我的热传感器感受到您炽热的内心了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_376_therex/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/phtjk8e14wpyw6o41389xn52r15qemo.mp3","text":"我的处理器已经被您的